{"id":"facilidad","lemma":"facilidad","pos":"noun","rank":4361,"glosses":["ease (skill, facility)"],"ipa":"/faθiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"facilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-facilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella terminó el trabajo con facilidad.","en":"She finished the job with ease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706926","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Él pudo resolver el problema con facilidad.","en":"He was able to solve the problem with ease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691874","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to resolve"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Encontré su oficina con facilidad.","en":"I found his office easily.","words":[{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"office"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Esta carne se corta con facilidad.","en":"This meat cuts easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636564","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"flesh"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"cutting"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Él resolvió con facilidad todos esos problemas.","en":"He solved all those problems with ease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706176","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to resolve","l":"resolver"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"}]}]}